# Cloudflare Pages serves this static frontend on groundworkbuild.com.
# The Flask backend on Railway renders several routes server-side
# (magic-link verification, the account area, admin) that don't exist as
# static files here. Without these rules, Cloudflare returns its own 404
# for those paths instead of ever reaching Railway — proxy them through
# transparently (200 = rewrite, keeps the groundworkbuild.com URL in the
# browser) rather than redirecting.
/verify/*   https://web-production-748b1.up.railway.app/verify/:splat   200
/account/*  https://web-production-748b1.up.railway.app/account/:splat  200
/admin/*    https://web-production-748b1.up.railway.app/admin/:splat    200
/api/*      https://web-production-748b1.up.railway.app/api/:splat      200
